// AWS MFA Device Deactivated  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1556.006, T1531
// Detects deactivation of an MFA device (DeactivateMFADevice). Removing MFA weakens authentication and can lock out or impersonate the…
// False positives: Legitimate MFA device replacement/offboarding.
// Source: rules/defense-evasion/iam-deactivate-mfa-device.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "DeactivateMFADevice" and eventSource =~ "iam.amazonaws.com"
